Whole-context initial-review reuse retains all three original compact observation pins, exports, launch/completion/trace, adapter/method/addendum bindings, and actual original sessions/wave. It is allowed only when the complete existing context plus declared recording method match and the entire first three reviews are complete with valid procedure, including unfavorable judgments. A changed member, source/view/provenance/method context, incomplete first record, or altered compact raw cannot be repaired by partial reuse or a critic replacement. The new preparer marks invalid initial evidence unready; it does not silently request three more critics.

